<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/january-1">1 January</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Powerful earthquake devastates Japan's Noto Peninsula</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">A magnitude 7.5 earthquake struck <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ishikawa-prefecture">Ishikawa Prefecture</a> on New Year's Day, triggering tsunami warnings, fires and landslides. Including later disaster-related deaths, more than 500 people lost their lives.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/hurricane-beryl" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/hurricane-beryl.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year">Event</p><h3 class="tih-event-title"><a href="/encyclopedia/hurricane-beryl">Hurricane Beryl</a></h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Hurricane Beryl was a powerful Atlantic hurricane of July 2024, the earliest on record to reach Category 5 strength.</p></div></li></ol></section>
